      "writtenOn": "2022-02-07T19:11:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks Christoffer and Rico for review, and good to know on the signatures/annotations. I actually don\u0027t think we have any `-keepattributes` rules in our base config (should we? see https://source.corp.google.com/android/build/make/core/proguard.flags and https://source.corp.google.com/android/build/make/core/proguard_basic_keeps.flags).\n\nSome of these rules are a bit more conservative than I\u0027d like, in follow-up work I\u0027ll trim them down as much as possible (testing across platforms is a bit annoying as there are a number of classes that get lit up depending on the platform... another area of improvement I\u0027m looking into, b/203143243).",
      "parentUuid": "33dc8f9d_fc8fd9aa",
      "revId": "748375b074e60e7e8f3be6c9081f502350e20b0f",
