      "writtenOn": "2022-02-04T20:08:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The library target doesn\u0027t include the manifest at all. The manifest is a bit odd, in that it\u0027s a mix of general system features and system_server-specific things like BroadcastReceivers.\n\nI was playing with a follow-up that feeds the manifest to the library rule, but will leave for a separate change. Tweaked the TODO accordingly.",
