      "writtenOn": "2022-02-03T08:15:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Consider moving this to the top of the file.\n\nHave you considered repackaging the non-kept part of the app into the default package to reduce size?:\n\n  -repackageclasses\n\nIf system server is not running in its own process, you would need to repackage into a system server namespace to avoid collisions, e.g.,\n\n  -repackageclasses com.android.server.SystemServer",
