      "side": 1,
      "message": "For now, we won\u0027t be doing any renaming or obfuscating (or even optimization), only shrinking. At some point we might consider that, but the current plan is 1) enable shrinking, 2) build out retracing infra further, 3) enable optimization. After that we\u0027ll consider repackaging.",
