      "writtenOn": "2022-02-04T20:08:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m actually not 100% sure on this one. The default rule is automatically included @ https://source.corp.google.com/android/build/make/core/proguard_basic_keeps.flags;rcl\u003dd7f4a1f54800975c215502ce556ffdc8bfdc3e08;l\u003d12, but doesn\u0027t have `includedescriptorclasses`. However, in google3 I see https://source.corp.google.com/piper///depot/google3/java/com/google/android/apps/common/proguard/base.pgcfg;rcl\u003d372369943;l\u003d25, which I also see in other places like https://github.com/facebookarchive/proguard/blob/master/examples/annotations/examples.pro#L36, so that\u0027s what I put here. Should we just update proguard_basic_keeps.flags to match what exists elsewhere (with `includedescriptorclasses`)?",
